{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38331","headline":"题延寿坊东南角古池 · 吴融","name":"题延寿坊东南角古池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蔓草萧森曲岸摧，水笼沙浅露莓苔。\n更无蔟蔟红妆点，犹有双双翠羽来。\n雨细几逢耕犊去，日斜时见钓人回。\n繁华自古皆相似，金谷荒园土一堆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38331.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38331","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}